{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o040c","title":"汝颍黄巾聚众依附诸军","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o040c-account","label":"正文","text":"正文补述何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼各聚数万，先后依附袁术、孙坚。","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0115","role":"聚众","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0116","role":"聚众","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0117","role":"聚众","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0118","role":"聚众","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"受依附","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0119","role":"受依附","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"汝南、颍川","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹操进讨汝颍之前","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o040c-q"]},"source_order":[1,259,"O040c"],"order":118}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0118","name":"何曼","evidence":["wudi-q-o040"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o040-wudi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o040"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o040c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":124},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
